{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 954,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ccba9494a90cca3649d6d7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近速度稍稍提升\\n在草地中距离比赛中\\n若技能发动时处于队伍中列或之后\\n则较长时间持续微弱提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0d55cebf5195495b182fbe516cb7df4506afc10775ea95b334fd84c588f643c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe4b776825ed467b90c71bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冲进终盘时位于后方且距离终点尚远\\n则短时间内向前极小幅突进\\n如果是中山竞马场或阪神竞马场的中长距离比赛\\n则之后在直线上短时间内向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b80a340c4ed4b38eefed7440d871fda0487d6ff1981942419948727761033011",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd808ecf73e5a047a696b141",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "第4浪时若位于前方则短时间\\n稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1597abb42f590f0ef8a992b6669f8a0557334bdc94879f0cb68590a92aefff83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf239bb71a76a46eb705a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道完成赶超后\\n在最终冲刺时速度稍微提升\\n若在短距离和英里比赛发动技能时\\n自身位于队伍中间,则变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a505e0988e0cf2084cd3b9fbf22501d8e54aa297bf8a600c7cdb64ffa26519f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51568504adf777ca2df9a236",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处若位于前方\\n则略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b6bbdc62f5722c11c65dc17d39ac6fd48cbba55595baa045f1efb0263169f9c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02bbdb70f9835bdc45cd2409",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段的直线处位于中间位置时\\n速度稍微提升\\n若是长距离比赛则提升效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "552c8a62298742ecd97073236b0a3a5933ec32a418622a0d40b40ac9484c58cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128186de9c47e116a078ea68",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道位于前方时\n短时间内少量向前突进＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a62934a5af8cde2ea6b9a918d65aa20d58043cf5820fca97b41ca2c6e4f7cf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39fcc35f1ca13da05bf00320",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余1000m处若身处前方\\n速度微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c188e4996c16d1ac0d07701ca307f5f08423e11056a1dde348554fa6ea4793ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba51e8d832df94651eec5033",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中间位于中后方时\\n短时间内稍微向前突进,若是短距离英里比赛\\n则之后最终冲刺时短时间内小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "7996a8cb760fd37fbd19d8f1d0453b208400a19145a747f7f2b09bfd799e6add",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fdb9d5d7e0e8e298564b309",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的某处速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb028d70dbb44b6ed7fafcb33935131c0380db172af30fcec3481b9c95178cfb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acef03571d396fb266f61a1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近短时间内速度微量提升＜先行・草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f6af0f3a70b111ee4360d85749834ee4d2551980ca8f48c4235beb4edbf7d36",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c9199a4e7b063f97d033eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n若附近有2名以上的赛马娘\\n则持续稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f669ea20327e10cd73c03b7784daffa1a78023aa417a752c5af7de81e33bfbec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f14a01d8da71c489b75a48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段持续少许提升速度\n若是2000m以上的比赛，\n之后会在最后冲刺阶段短暂少许提升加速度<居中/后追>",
      "source_fingerprint": "f01d2fe88835e23e56ccfc4487e705bf297a4dae1a22336c639903a5ff0359af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f6513df26d3a269fb94235",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘位于中团及以后且余力充足时\\n稍微向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f2561e206e9e3bce91ebeefece98f7a85604ce8d0d90f42f33c60e828c3c0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b2094a7f81107f8cf0ab9dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘初期位于中团及以前时长时间\n持续略微向前突进<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c098352ce9265096443d8300e6064f9e3402f3b2da8802fd9c1b95d8251b65",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b90d90320c4b0ee81ce2b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段一段时间内稍微提升速度\\n若是2000m以上的比赛,则在此之后\\n于最后冲刺阶段短暂地\\n稍微提升加速度＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d731df6584bc720d008180d3268ab0e19ba756776c3e150ccca6698ccb6af1d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25e29bf0b6d2662b32f1c98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入中盘时若身处后方,在临近终盘时\\n微幅向前突进,若是中距离比赛,之后\\n进入最终直线时若身处前方,则\\n极微幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "508a42600d904ed86e628e25e8cbe4f8edc12f9162658fd48478d782a9c0bc97",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6423e01a1a01cd2a6555926",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑顺利的话\\n长时间持续稍微向前突进\\n＜先行/追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11eefdc8f5f9f6405f510f1a795fe1ee0977738fa0b150c8a05c954fcd3fc66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "901451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca0018f673dd898a77091582",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时如果使用了两次技能\\n且位于队伍中间时\\n回复少量体力并略微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff95432ee4396cbe2a213642947985b3cc30db65f6ac74215d7927ac5e00bfb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaa440f0e3328ca382de9c00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘处于领头位置时极小幅度向前突进\\n若此时为第三弯道并且中盘拉开巨大差距\\n领先时,稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "27058c182d280a7719156ed89191229e80aa26a92406de0545e8b4859b51c4aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf046b00b00d53ca145e3f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后\\n位于前列穷追不舍时\\n会在最终直线稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "84ff87156efc45103954327a8488e3132595ee618f7d3579821844825274cc5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef719f3b40daefce026828d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若使用技能回复过体力\\n且比赛后半程在队伍前方时\\n速度微微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "934d9e4c9958b88f3d979cbb880e1c333b951fba6a0a5d7b4d536b295222399e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98b9b286b3894db9ac534bda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后,在先头集团突围时\\n短时间速度稍微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0198ac361ceab11e5511b85a507c94120732a31743cb9c01143e1e70f68bd88",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18670bef5f867ad782fab75d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若使用技能回复了3次以上的耐力\\n则会在比赛后半稍微调整一下呼吸\\n朝着胜利向前迈进",
      "source_fingerprint": "afd73ffed1d865d48a1d8d84d2bf5b65f1bc50de3337e287f3f3ae4fc2d8ef40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:794da406223f9f49b5dfda2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的某个地方微量提升速度\\n并且无视条件\\n发动一个可以使用的金技能",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcadb4baec70384861a217c88433605dc186dd182d209c7132edd1c12beb62cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdf8e892c2ed48ee4b4216b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入中盘之后在下坡时位于中间集团\\n则下完坡后在短时间内速度少量提升\\n如果位于东京竞马场则再次推高档位",
      "source_fingerprint": "927d02d7bc12d251617b53072ae6ada4065e1fbeb005e3286ccdc2bba7009a41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d581f7c372c7decce7ac9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的直线位于前方时速度微量持续上升\\n位于领头位置并与后方马娘距离较近时\\n技能效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "7930fd35f41c7331d54f1e82691983b76b172c4e7e2b7a7945dd9457ae6ab70b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdaca60275055ee5d199340b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余200m处位于队伍前方时略微提高速度\\n若此时距前方赛马娘较近时\\n略微向前冲刺一点点",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a41d093713014d2522d87e30bc227f389fde3def825ce4af9174bc564e7bd8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:845d0854999340413cb0c67b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于后方且名次下降时\\n以温柔的治愈之光回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f106c184e3ae3900bb21a4dbe925cc9dbde3beb9811e6e80479233ea41bc65ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66e3f40d156582d5a5c6680",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成三次追赶,在临近终盘的下坡路\\n位于后方时,短时间内速度稍微提升\\n并提升极少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "89cf3c87670c7ce02e4a0a3e95aedbabe847d74455793afc474fdc9893438669",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1e2421efd2349f988e9d94",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘最终弯道处于前方时被超越时\\n速度持续稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "95abf8bd3a1b24df6cf11e8f206cffcf4b0e1df27b2928b01b4080812e217dd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45650b7b9db84d386d893cff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时从队伍中团向前移动时\\n灵魂会沸腾燃烧,稍微加速能力",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cd69b948445221c1feea4d59e1c83fe11465144f5ace6e62a36ac55a38e515",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55cb3aaaa88b8e9d30d7f54f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "距终点400米的位置身处前方时速度稍微提升\\n若是比赛中合计使用过7次技能\\n变为小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42fec8e2e92f8e5b1d48a5f325706a90d1605baed24faae1b46bb1fb66f8ba5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bf8dcc6601fb5962b6b77a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的最终弯道后半处位于前列时\\n速度略微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "106bd77ddfd9b9002f86929103b81392384beefce272c36f62a618ce9b8c2e09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e341714ae4c28500fe6a2094",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘身处前方,有被反超的危险时\\n会在最终弯道前使速度持续稍微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0540085668e79c7983c432f496c09d96e99a289357ce45d23830a61594299e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70644879fa22e414d8437b5d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若比赛中盘处于队伍前方\\n并开始追逐前方的马娘的话\\n则速度上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a077a613de4d74d3c4cfe31e0fa4e01a43e40a03e4c547f1c927d32af23f2b89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33105e7c1cf66e0fbc6c16d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘的弯道位于中间集团往后的位置\\n且附近有3名及以上的马娘时\\n速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "55316ce56d1ba74220423daffa5be2c87160572d7c85ba37cac9fd6e8bd61b7f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f4a7f10867e424ca9f796a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的直线身处前方时,会稍微提\\n升速度。若这恰巧也是看台对面\\n跑道,还会一并略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8fe27c23508083b0ad210bb0c51a84f21a1ae0a6afc1b960f4d2d377d01a0fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4663e93cef21c26858d393cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘发动两次技能时\\n速度微量持续上升,若在效果持续中继续发动技能\\n会提升效果速度量,最大两次",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c1c13a342d8a44fa8ba9c88cf1560af638acd79192c1094360b6b638d45c75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2666db5d2386b85e77722e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘最终弯道往后处于好位置时提升速度\\n若距离终点尚远\\n则会略微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96d88db82ca425ae91d8876a0e1957839201a8af6341e08f29adebfcdcfb00c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a78eb04f51a0b60432e2827f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若自比赛开始直到后半为止\\n能一直处于良好的位置\\n则比赛中盘时速度会上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "001a5671dfe61f46f5b27ae93778f1a11563d1e82f6b7379cfea75ecb9b17004",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e3d7a27e4bdb2a5ba90498f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道前\\n在前方完成超越时稍微提升速度\\n在后方完成超越时则稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "db81f479d01bb0055e25e45678e1e3e6e9eaf7d37146cf2cedb4f4fd0e55a32a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ee7b69edc885eae94ddc76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段若一直位于队伍中后方\\n则在比赛终盘的最终弯道以及往后\\n向前极小幅突进\\n如果是长距离比赛则增加效果量",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebac0bd5a9487482f138016233483a55f53c5fbdc419f79da137c27d2d7ecad6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c591d9e4df4e62e4544a5b32",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘弯道处于前列、\\n检测到后面有其他马娘时\\n则会微量回复体力,且速度略微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4846d2cb8deba83e0257446dfd27f60bf2df1569a91d45ee9ff20a2fb19573e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa48e5dcf6c56d6c51acd8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘的下坡处在第二名开外距离领头4马身\\n以内时,短时间内速度略微提升\\n中距离比赛则额外略微提升少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c60c3aa4e3f177d8be854bf7bf85184e359f636c62ecb82349b5b46ad45ef02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3053c29a76f3a97b6e59c38b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近中盘的某一刻处于优势位置时\\n会在短时间内小幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "22720e869c3e08598d64595857e61aa1c65922bec5ce7d0a01af0fbe81375aa3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94a2e87396bcd1defa4cbfce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段附近在前方开始加速时\\n短时间内略微提升速度\\n若是英里比赛\\n则增加速度量",
      "source_fingerprint": "c210b74fd042bca01143886ae8774bce860a13604242ff2e821cb712e21093af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aab069169816f8d2ce7b21c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘身处好位置时\\n会稍微吸取前方赛马娘的持久力\\n并且微幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6eb53eeb9784e0bda3725d3f913b97bdd561425cf258b6e89f6290564d77d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d1e40ba1fa6f451fb29834d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘开头位于前方时\\n速度略微持续上升\\n并略微回复体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c41712bdf10b58fd9393f793f8805eaa240567f0a64db41fa96d02dba4953f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e17b10e0de5dd1c7b862a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的弯道位于好位置时,短时间\\n内速度大幅提升,若是中山竞马场\\n则根据自身速度同时提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "076b8b5195cd4e66d10c3419b16a28866a5047b1f02f967acafa88a59bd60b9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac93a5739841726bd5e67b26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道以后处在队伍中后方时\\n稍微提升加速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fd1b4e3b1193bc19833fb13d16da1ff71e2f667238a2402100fb47ab9ea83c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eddbd1b1ce42ee45e4e97b15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的弯道处从后方逼近对手时\\n到最终直线会提升少量速度\\n并根据终盘弯道处超过对手次数提升效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "af91d4e3d40e40365da90ea18eac6f380ade78fb258b26cbc39f525b8439e54e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf4641e2acb2a3d4360e5d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线进行最后冲刺时位于中间集团往后\\n则速度逐渐微量提升,效果持续中\\n每发动一次技能提高一次速度,最大3次",
      "source_fingerprint": "789d0e03bcb3a84e9180a5362aa568d172a016653490852fd7d7561ebee33eb6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b93b12d3fba2da7255181efa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘的最终弯道后半之后,进行赶超时速度稍微提升\\n如果比赛中盘在中间位置被人超越过\\n则变为速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb301356d4481e57c85a0046d221eb35def37986c5ea792d51f765f5db1aba4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2081f012cc2934988b1dfd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后完成2次超越的话\\n将把荣耀化作力量\\n在最终直线持续稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0bb5a5bde94c37cc7c521375f036a7f1db1d3bcff30e59a7f85bf9b87f5f0f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910371"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4807737bd0d2b96fd31219a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余350m处于前方\\n且与后方马娘距离接近时\\n稍微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4ef120b3ba7f729bbd4a068278e73219f51c1158cf342e4ba092a1538d0815",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dd55ff1abf3af7555a76489",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘之后的上坡处位于队伍中间时\\n上完坡后稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c442397f3a2cc5428227c90355f05a6ac5b5ebbb9226dfa5021ffcdeb4240c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6877c85b243e459301ab5924",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在最终弯道上处于队伍中部\\n且与其她赛马娘相互竞争时\\n则略微容易脱离",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e883d5539ef8ed612a3bc1b8464df81b2ed632e31ec75b9fa7a02cd672c904",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebd59a6361201d3d948a232",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛剩余400m处位于前三名\\n则短时间内提升极少加速度\\n在中盘竞争持续时间越长\\n则技能效果越好,技能持续时间越长",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86d9536d1f093dc121afb8c6a788fa82d5bed54eab6488f5f5c35b0a6f1ac4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d6a7bb5318921f751871bc2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段在前方准备超越时\\n略微向前突进,若是短距离或者英里比赛\\n则之后在最终弯道完成超越时速度极小幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1208c9a0749b2b4dc9d9f71c0e5ec331a22b5101e8e954106e0068b59265e656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4623c86fbc502cddf4659128",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "准备超越时稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3c146095ebf9e0e7243e16b5086fb4dda75982f8255d713105ce193e29d7dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910431"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae406147ab7240af07a9bb84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘以后的下坡位于后方时\\n稍微消耗体力\\n短时间内小幅度向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "85498b8c5401f6827fc0b07ddab75a58d3a36d08761fb846ddfb03111e7c9f53",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a77ef3a340b275f5386e7b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线处于好位置\\n且与前方赛马娘的距离很近的话\\n略微容易完成超越",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f65476b42a7c49668736b9119c2401db162bacfd1e51b3f9a2d8124c5e5fdbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4bb854b736d3fb6b9d14cae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中段位于领头附近时\\n速度逐渐微量提升,在沙土比赛中\\n额外回复微量体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "92fac1ee960ad4b4efc5977125d4c15eee92e02aae7d1a133b0fb23017b583cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24cc8b62224e72fadc061d5c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线位于前方时\\n速度微量提升,若是东京竞马场的中距离比赛或者中山竞马场的2500m比赛\\n则额外向前极小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c28566eeff0a61d4c4b6595ed177cc49c5ca3a23bc708a9f63470b5449ef29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5933ec1d73261c9a1d6ed8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段前后位于队伍中间时\\n速度微量持续上升\\n如果心情绝好调则效果提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "088a1803cf0307564a7bb7a1cf26f11259122c9cf29a80becb514851de38c7e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:595b36f87ddd218dbc484f6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在中盘初期的某处降低速度，\n此后在终盘迫近的某处若位于中团\n则持续少许提升速度<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8ba5863fd35e023801f9391c40794bf9683fe7a6feb0e29e2e0bb0cf04daba0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42fc96f8388ae02413944554",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的最终弯道后半\\n从中间集团开始提高少量速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a911ce28eb01f0aa1603f569b60d3d5b5f5999fc4594b98d938829fc0b27cb7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:695fa57e2b913e2a05244d95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余200m的地点自身位于第二名\\n与中间队伍之间的位置时,速度稍微提升\\n且附近赛马娘数量达3人以上时再稍微向前小幅突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60e2d3dd6f34029eb4de5874ee75a1cff6043bed160d86537e68c26ba39a1ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910511"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aa48d7ef34d5b7c1dbd2bf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上若与先头集团拉开了距离\\n则拉开的距离越远就越要继续努力\\n速度会一点点提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f67d9dc7727ac64e8d75d2f326310923ef1d287d8a35c1ac11de68bc9beab5e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e519176235dbde55c8cab8dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余200m处位于前方时速度略微提升\\n若在短距离比赛的终盘进行过赶超\\n则速度少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd866d94396b87a84171ac77333acc122bfd47d685a97bc3d3d8f2707fedf4c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c595e0420bcabbeafcc249d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道处于中间集团时\\n若附近有其他赛马娘，则在最终直线上\\n速度会小幅提升，并且\\n状态绝佳时会极小幅向前冲出",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce89cc2fe678e838c0b806973d7253db64a8c6597ad6c7e2fc5579ca99c3e0d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e67fff163c7b73fc128242",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半程在队伍后方被堵住时\\n幸运之力会眷顾其身\\n速度微微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f531e06c4e853d8409610267027c438347c8f7ebf822dba59ea2e027424a664e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cd8a8a04052b4eb4fda586",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段位于后方时,根据\\n剩余耐力进行相应时间的长距离冲刺\\n使速度持续极少量提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc464ce9a9f99df6b4189ef80ad48c191adfd9976664d38fdaa74359a8a3a4f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0006390fe7579470f4858fbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线时若位于前方\\n则提升少量速度\\n并使前后各2名赛马娘略微畏惧",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53b972c0c25f879a2ed847f6d1ffbd64cd0a756e5905b0e6652a63351f7a871",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e86427f82fc2b8bfc37cce3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘的下坡处、位于队伍中央\\n且距离终点较远时\\n速度略微上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1014d83954cb62aa3959208c04b59d53fe6bd8f908338d26fd7b322e6f4be948",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3cd57bd7aedb1ff81e4a9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后超过对手\\n并在最终直线处于中间集团时略微加快速度\\n若人气处于后列则能持续提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "64626c8d470e0a464e916a6ca4f0c8adf20971f776b54e43b05a09a66300702c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:314d43d052b6b6cc2b162104",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程前半,没有焦躁并处于最后方附近\\n等待机会时,在最终直线\\n会略微提高加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9402dcd6c3329110c4dc4c9229e2071af7c693df58032f73d8ee79e761fe756",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "910611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b61f7b321474a33f9a091a07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若在比赛后半的弯道处位于队伍中间\\n则根据剩余体力在相应时间内略微提升速度\\n中距离比赛时额外提升极少加速度",
